 POST   /api/auth/forgot-password/
Request a password reset
Auth required: None
Looks up the account by email, generates a single-use reset token valid for 1 hour, and emails a reset link built from FRONTEND_URL.
Request Body:
Field	Type	Description
email	string	Required
Example Response:
