 GET   /api/auth/users/
List all users (admin only)
Auth required: Required — admin role
Returns every user account. Supports filtering by role.
Query / URL Parameters:
Parameter	Description
?role=user|admin	Filter the list to a single role
Example Response:
[
  { "id": "...", "email": "...", "role": "user", ... },
