Retrieve, update, or deactivate a user (admin only)
Auth required: Required — admin role
GET returns the user's profile; PUT updates it. DELETE does not hard-delete — it sets is_active=False (soft delete), preventing that account from logging in while preserving its historical incidents/data. An admin cannot deactivate their own account (returns 400).
